{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"victoria-de-mare","name":"Victoria De Mare","birthDate":"1974-01-01","birthPlace":"Wilmington, Delaware, USA","bio":"Victoria De Mare is one of Hollywood's reigning \"Hottest Horror Scream Queens\" for over a decade according to the cover feature editorial article, interview, & pictorial of the January 2017 issue of Hustler Magazine. She has over 150 Film & TV credits including music & counting. She is best known for her creation & portrayal of the sexy demon succubus clown, \"Batty Boop\" from the horror/comedy feature film series, 'Killjoy'.\n\nVictoria is a graduate of New York University with a Bachelor of Arts in Theatre Arts and Broadcast Journalism. In addition to being an award-winning character actor, she is also a published writer, published poet, published professional model, LACMA(Los Angeles County Museum of Art) exhibit art model, live TV talk show host & producer(SKY Channel UK & Europe) as well as a professional dancer. Victoria is also a professional lead, back-up, harmony, & \"ghost\" vocalist as well as an award-winning songwriter, composer, arranger, music producer, & music publisher(ASCAP).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:04:22+00:00","tmdbId":104458,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/104458","credits":[{"id":"deadpool","title":"Deadpool","character":"Stripper (uncredited)","characterFa":"استریپر (بی اعتبار)"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/victoria-de-mare.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Darkness of Man","year":2025,"character":"Makeup Room Girl","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nxlUo0jbVdGfixcZLlfZ66KPaFh.jpg"},{"name":"The Beast Inside","year":2024,"character":"Demon","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/coHGzl4RRHNkQoDMHCN9VARAX64.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Magick","year":2024,"character":"The Proprietress","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lKGIZ1FYjYXnlgF2Etq6W5rVBMt.jpg"},{"name":"End Times","year":2023,"char